- sublicense the Work without permission; or
- distribute a substantial rewrite or reconstruction of the Work where this licence does not permit it.

For other violations that can be corrected, Your rights are automatically restored if You correct the violation within 30 days after becoming aware of it or receiving written notice of it.

Rights terminated because of an intentional violation listed above are restored only if the Licensor gives written permission.

Termination applies only to rights granted under CleanroomMC License.

It does not terminate rights independently granted to You under a different licence governing separately licensed material.

Termination of Your rights does not terminate the rights of another person who previously received the Work through Distribution that complied with this licence and who continues to comply with it.

Sections intended to continue after termination, including warranty disclaimers, limitations of liability, trademark provisions, and accrued obligations, continue to apply.

